purpose, please let me know the documentation required from my end(I 
understand a smooth exist with the standard experience/relieving letter 
was discussed) , I'm happy to cooperate, though I'd note this isn't a 
resignation on my part.

Could you also share a copy of my last signed 90-day notice/bond 
agreement form my records, and confirm the 30 day notice-pay terms in 
writing?

Thanks
Rahul Dubey
